        "metadata": {
          "category": "stories",
          "media": {
            "duration": 4745,
            "fileSize": 76927639
          },
          "author": "Leisha Stewart-Sharpe",
          "description": "Planet Earth contains many hidden worlds.    \n\nThere is the Green Planet where plants care for other plants and can smell, taste, touch, hear and even...'talk'.    There is the Blue Planet: a beautiful blue marble suspended in a sea of stars.    \n\nAnd there is the Frozen Planet made up of ice kingdoms, where orcas sneak up on bowhead whales while they're relaxing in the spa.    \n\nDiscover all there is to love about our astonishing Planet Earth in this audio collection.",
